Beskar), but a wearer of the Beskar'gam is a fearsome sight indeed.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A suit of Beskar'gam grants ",{"tag":"a","children":["Favorable Circumstances"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Favorable_Circumstances"}," on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," checks made to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intimidate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intimidate"},", and if the wearer has ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"}," then the wearer can apply its benefit against attacks made by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},". Though not Powered Armor, Beskar'gam Armor has two free ",{"tag":"a","children":["Upgrade Slots"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Upgrade_Slots"},". Gamemasters can reduce the cost of Beskar'gam by 30,000 credits for Mandalorian heroes.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Medium Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Medium_Armor","referenceId":"reference:e2a45d7d144d40dd"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 37,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},":"]}," +8\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},":"]}," +2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Maximum ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," Bonus:"]}," +2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 17 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," 